 "description": "Perched atop one of the neighborhood's premier waterfront buildings, this expansive duplex penthouse offers a rare combination of scale, light, and sweeping views. Floor-to-ceiling windows frame open outlooks across the harbor and skyline, while a private landscaped terrace extends the living space outdoors.\n\nThe main level features a sun-filled great room, a formal dining room, and a windowed chef's kitchen outfitted with premium appliances and custom cabinetry. A library and two powder rooms complete the entertaining floor.\n\nBelow, a serene primary suite enjoys wall-to-wall windows, dual walk-in closets, and a spa-style marble bath. Additional bedrooms, each with generous closets and en-suite or nearby baths, provide comfort and flexibility for family and guests.\n\nThe full-service building offers a 24-hour doorman, a state-of-the-art fitness center, children's playrooms, a screening room, on-site parking, and beautifully landscaped courtyards, all moments from waterfront parks and greenways.",
